WEBVTT

00:00:00.486 --> 00:00:01.673
<v Narration>Teach one phone task.

00:00:02.221 --> 00:00:04.241
<v Narration>Reuse it with new words and values.

00:00:09.246 --> 00:00:13.117
<v Request>Teach. Order a Margherita pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

00:00:16.245 --> 00:00:19.375
<v EchoFlow>Okay, show me in Zomato. Tap Done when you're finished. I never pay.

00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:24.542
<v Request>Record my taps.

00:00:25.971 --> 00:00:29.701
<v EchoFlow>Okay, I'll record your taps myself from now on. If I missed one, go back and tap it again.

00:00:30.926 --> 00:00:32.638
<v Narration>The lesson starts inside Zomato.

00:00:33.177 --> 00:00:34.853
<v Narration>We demonstrate the restaurant search,

00:00:34.997 --> 00:00:36.374
<v Narration>pizza selection, and cart.

00:00:37.372 --> 00:00:40.325
<v Narration>EchoFlow turns those screen actions into a reusable task,

00:00:40.479 --> 00:00:42.907
<v Narration>without a custom integration for this ordering app.

00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:03.086
<v EchoFlow>Learned: order amargeria pizza from brick oven on zomato. I saved 10 steps.

00:01:03.086 --> 00:01:06.206
<v EchoFlow>You can change the item, restaurant. You can see it in the EchoFlow app.

00:01:07.393 --> 00:01:09.975
<v Narration>The saved lesson is the starting point for each replay.

00:01:10.504 --> 00:01:11.872
<v Narration>We do not teach it again.

00:01:16.428 --> 00:01:19.389
<v Request>Order a Margherita pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:22.795
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order margherita pizza from brik oven on zomato.

00:01:23.976 --> 00:01:25.969
<v Narration>First, we repeat the original request.

00:01:26.498 --> 00:01:29.252
<v Narration>The learned flow works through the restaurant's live interface.

00:01:41.879 --> 00:01:47.439
<v EchoFlow>Your turn. Everything is ready for payment, total ₹285. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

00:01:55.093 --> 00:01:57.238
<v Request>Get me a Margherita, from Brik Oven.

00:01:58.385 --> 00:02:00.575
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order margherita pizza from brik oven on zomato.

00:02:01.755 --> 00:02:04.364
<v Narration>Now the words change, while the task stays the same.

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:06.270
<v Narration>The same lesson is reused.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:19.278
<v EchoFlow>Margherita was already in your cart, so I didn't add another one. Your turn.

00:02:19.278 --> 00:02:24.061
<v EchoFlow>Everything is ready for payment, total ₹285. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

00:02:30.842 --> 00:02:34.355
<v Request>Order a couple of Farmhouse pizzas, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

00:02:36.348 --> 00:02:38.668
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order 2 farmhouse pizza from brik oven on zomato.

00:02:39.879 --> 00:02:41.936
<v Narration>Next, we change the dish and quantity.

00:02:42.456 --> 00:02:45.128
<v Narration>Two Farmhouse pizzas were not part of the demonstration.

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:48.597
<v Narration>A new item means finding its current menu entry.

00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:51.092
<v Narration>The replay still has to reach the right cart.

00:03:04.968 --> 00:03:09.053
<v EchoFlow>I added farmhouse with the options that were already selected, ₹260. Your turn.

00:03:09.053 --> 00:03:14.178
<v EchoFlow>Everything is ready for payment, total ₹936. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

00:03:21.037 --> 00:03:23.953
<v Request>Order a unicorn pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.330
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order unicorn pizza from brik oven on zomato.

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:39.388
<v EchoFlow>I searched for "unicorn" at brik oven but couldn't find it. What should I get instead?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.340
<v Request>Nothing.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:48.810
<v EchoFlow>I searched for "unicorn" at brik oven but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 8 without adding anything.

00:03:54.556 --> 00:03:55.923
<v Request>Did the last run succeed?

00:03:57.140 --> 00:04:02.314
<v EchoFlow>No, the last run didn't succeed. Order unicorn pizza from brik oven on zomato stopped at step 8 of 10 (Tap "ADD").

00:04:02.314 --> 00:04:07.130
<v EchoFlow>I searched for "unicorn" at brik oven but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 8 without adding anything.

00:04:09.286 --> 00:04:09.948
<v Narration>One lesson.

00:04:10.477 --> 00:04:11.202
<v Narration>New requests.

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:13.621
<v Narration>A real cart, with payment left to you.
